OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan set for first
OL,4,Aevent since UK return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are due
OL,7,Fto visit Nottingham this week in what
OL,8,Fwill be their first royal-style joint
OL,9,Fengagement since returning to the UK.
OL,11,FHarry and Meghan are expected in the
OL,12,Fcity on Thursday, which is where they
OL,13,Fmade their first joint appearance after
OL,14,Fannouncing their engagement in 2017.
OL,16,FIt is believed the pair will visit a
OL,17,Fnumber of organisations, including a
OL,18,Fcommunity recording studio that Harry
OL,19,Fhas been to before, most recently in
OL,20,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
