OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan set for first
OL,4,Aevent since UK return
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince the pair and their children,
OL,7,FPrince Archie and Princess Lilibet,
OL,8,Freturned to the UK in August after
OL,9,Fliving in the US for six years, they
OL,10,Fhave been involved in a public spat
OL,11,Fwith Buckingham Palace about their
OL,12,Fstatus and security detail.
